   "expected": "  | overdue on 2026-10-15\n  | M007 Clean Code: 5 day(s) late, fine 10000\n  | total fine 10000\n  returned 1\n  | overdue on 2026-10-21\n  | M007 Clean Code: 11 day(s) late, fine 22000\n  | M012 Refactoring: 6 day(s) late, fine 12000\n  | M003 Head First Java: 3 day(s) late, fine 6000\n  | total fine 40000\n  returned 3\n"
